The researcher alone, 12 runs each, asked the same question two ways.

  the sub-question as written         8 of 12
  with the analyst's figure attached 12 of 12

Adding one sentence the analyst already had moved it from 8 to 12.
The researcher was not worse at reading. It was working without the half
of the question its colleague was holding.

Either way, note what this experiment is: the fix for an agent boundary is to
pass more of the context across it. Do that thoroughly enough and you have
rebuilt the single agent, with extra network hops.
